---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How We Build Custom Homes | Utah Oasis Homes"
  description="Explore the Utah Oasis Homes custom building process, from discovery and design through construction, final walkthrough, and move-in."
  canonicalPath="/process"
>
  <section class="section process-page" id="process-page">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumbs">
      <ol class="breadcrumbs-list">
        <li class="breadcrumbs-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li class="breadcrumbs-separator" aria-hidden="true">→</li>
        <li class="breadcrumbs-item breadcrumbs-current">How We Build</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <header class="process-page-intro">
      <div class="pill-eyebrow">How We Build</div>
      <h1>A Calm, Clear Building Experience</h1>
      <p>
        From the first conversation through move-in, every phase has defined decisions, dependable
        communication, and direct oversight from the person responsible for the work.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="process-page-hero">
      <img
        src="/images/process-courtyard.jpg"
        alt="A covered courtyard with skylights, large windows, and indoor-outdoor living spaces"
        width="1400"
        height="1050"
        loading="eager"
      />

      <aside class="process-page-promise" aria-labelledby="process-promise-title">
        <div class="process-page-promise-label">Our Promise</div>
        <h2 id="process-promise-title">You will always know what comes next.</h2>
        <p>
          Regular updates, timely decisions, and hands-on coordination make progress easy to follow.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="process-timeline" aria-label="The four phases of building your home">
      <article class="process-phase">
        <div class="process-phase-marker" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
        <div class="process-phase-main">
          <div class="process-phase-copy">
            <div class="process-phase-label">Discover</div>
            <h2>Begin with what matters most</h2>
            <p>
              We start by listening. Together, we clarify how you want to live, what you value,
              and how your property, priorities, investment, and timing shape the opportunity.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-phase-expectations">
            <h3>What to expect</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Vision and lifestyle conversation</li>
              <li>Property and site considerations</li>
              <li>Budget and timeline alignment</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="process-phase">
        <div class="process-phase-marker" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
        <div class="process-phase-main">
          <div class="process-phase-copy">
            <div class="process-phase-label">Design</div>
            <h2>Shape the home around your life</h2>
            <p>
              With trusted design partners, we translate your priorities into a cohesive plan for
              room relationships, natural light, views, materials, and daily routines.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-phase-expectations">
            <h3>What to expect</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Floor-plan development and refinement</li>
              <li>Materials, finishes, and key selections</li>
              <li>Clear decisions before construction</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="process-phase">
        <div class="process-phase-marker" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
        <div class="process-phase-main">
          <div class="process-phase-copy">
            <div class="process-phase-label">Build</div>
            <h2>Bring the vision to life with care</h2>
            <p>
              Troy coordinates the work, monitors quality, and keeps schedules and trades aligned.
              Progress updates and purposeful walkthroughs keep you connected without requiring you
              to manage the job yourself.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-phase-expectations">
            <h3>What to expect</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Coordinated schedules and trade partners</li>
              <li>Consistent progress communication</li>
              <li>Site walkthroughs and quality oversight</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="process-phase">
        <div class="process-phase-marker" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
        <div class="process-phase-main">
          <div class="process-phase-copy">
            <div class="process-phase-label">Live</div>
            <h2>Settle into a home made for you</h2>
            <p>
              We finish with the same attention that guided the build, preparing you for a confident
              handover and remaining available as you settle into the rhythms of your new home.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-phase-expectations">
            <h3>What to expect</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Detailed final walkthrough</li>
              <li>Thoughtful handover and orientation</li>
              <li>Continued support after move-in</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="process-consistency" aria-labelledby="process-consistency-title">
      <div class="process-consistency-heading">
        <div class="pill-eyebrow">From Start to Finish</div>
        <h2 id="process-consistency-title">What Remains Consistent Throughout</h2>
        <p>The same working standards apply from the earliest decisions through the final walkthrough.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-consistency-grid">
        <article>
          <div class="process-consistency-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
              <path d="M4 5.5h11a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v4a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H9l-4.5 3v-3.6A3 3 0 0 1 2 12V8.5a3 3 0 0 1 2-3Z" />
              <path d="M7 9.5h6M7 12.5h4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Direct Communication</h3>
          <p>Responsive conversations and scheduled updates keep you informed without chasing answers.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="process-consistency-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" />
              <path d="m14.8 9.2-1.7 3.9-3.9 1.7 1.7-3.9 3.9-1.7Z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Thoughtful Guidance</h3>
          <p>Important decisions are considered in context, with practical direction when you need it.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="process-consistency-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">
              <path d="M3.5 12s3.1-5.5 8.5-5.5 8.5 5.5 8.5 5.5-3.1 5.5-8.5 5.5S3.5 12 3.5 12Z" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5" />
              <path d="m15.8 17.2 1.4 1.4 3-3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Careful Oversight</h3>
          <p>Construction quality, finish details, and day-to-day coordination receive direct attention.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="process-page-cta" aria-labelledby="process-cta-title">
      <div>
        <div class="pill-eyebrow">Ready When You Are</div>
        <h2 id="process-cta-title">Let’s Begin with a Conversation</h2>
        <p>
          Tell us what you are imagining, where you hope to build, and what matters most to you.
          We will help you understand the next step.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/start" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Home</a>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
